// =============================================================
// Smart Glove Phase 10 — Master Inference (v6 — FINAL)
// Board  : ESP32-S3 DevKitC-1 (Right Hand / Master)
// Core   : ESP32 2.0.17  (GCC 8.4 — do NOT upgrade to 3.x)
// Library: TensorFlowLite_ESP32 1.0.0
// Patches: stl_emulation.h ~386 comment out count_=other.count_;
//          move src/screen and src/bus out of src/ folder
// =============================================================
// PREPROCESSING matches live_inference.py EXACTLY:
//   1. analogRead  → EMA filter (alpha=0.25)  [all 16 channels]
//   2. EMA fingers → normalise 0-1 (cal_min/cal_max)
//   3. EMA IMU     → pass through in degrees (no normalise)
//   4. Build 16-feature vector (FEATURE_ORDER from config.py)
//   5. Drop R_Yaw(idx7) and L_Yaw(idx15) → 14 features
//   6. Z-score each of the 14 channels across 60-frame window
//   7. Run model → 10-class softmax
//   8. Stabilise: confidence>=0.85, same class x3, 1.5s cooldown
// =============================================================
// CHANGES v6 vs v5:
//   [FIX-E] Calibration loaded from calibration_data.h on boot.
//           firmware cal_open/cal_close used min()/max() to set
//           cal_min/cal_max, which INVERTED the normalization
//           direction for any sensor where the open hand gives a
//           higher ADC reading than the closed hand.
//           For this glove: R_Thumb, R_Index, R_Middle, L_Ring
//           were all inverted. The model sees open=1.0 but was
//           trained on open=0.0 for those channels.
//           Fix: calibration_data.h uses open=cal_min, close=cal_max
//           directly from the Python JSON, preserving true direction.
//           norm_finger() already handles negative range correctly.
//
//   [FIX-F] cal_open/cal_close commands fixed (kept as optional
//           override): no longer uses min()/max() — now correctly
//           stores open snap as cal_min and close snap as cal_max.
//           Range check now uses fabsf() to handle inverted sensors.
//
//   [CARRIED] FIX-C: EMA applied to all 16 channels including IMU
//   [CARRIED] FIX-D: EMA sentinel changed to EMA_UNINIT (-9999)
//
// REQUIRED FILES in the same folder as this .ino:
//   model_data.h         — float32 TFLite model (from Colab, ~97 KB)
//   calibration_data.h   — from gen_cal_header.py (run after calibrating)
//
// WORKFLOW (after any change to calibration):
//   1. python3 main.py  →  calibrate in Dataset Studio
//   2. python3 gen_cal_header.py --profile "Your Profile"
//   3. Copy calibration_data.h to this firmware folder
//   4. Compile and flash
// =============================================================

